*.tmp

# ------------------------------------------------- Internal planning notes
# Working documents from before the risk-model, migration, admin and agility
# work. They describe a single-model Mosca engine, X and Y as per-algorithm
# constants and the old product name, all of which the README now contradicts.
# Kept locally as history; not published, because a repository whose own docs
# disagree with each other is worse than one with fewer docs.
prd.md
architecture.md
current_state.md
implementation_plan.md
phase_scope.md
app_flow.md
mosca_algorithm_worksheet.md
